11
01:06:41,250 --> 01:06:47,250
Fackham Hall is a 2025 period slapstick comedy parody film directed by Jim O'Hanlon
and co-written by Jimmy Carr, Patrick Carr, and The Dawson Brothers.

12
01:12:45,000 --> 01:12:51,000
The film stars Thomasin McKenzie, Ben Radcliffe, Katherine Waterston, Emma Laird, Tom
Goodman-Hill, Anna Maxwell Martin, Sue Johnston, Tom Felton, and Damian Lewis.

13
01:18:48,750 --> 01:18:54,750
Fackham Hall was released in the United States by Bleecker Street on December 5, 2025, and in
the United Kingdom by Entertainment Film Distributors on December 12, 2025.

14
01:24:52,500 --> 01:24:58,500
The film explores themes of social satire,
historical comedy, witty, hilarious, amused.

